"Take/drop/equip/unequip/eat stop being innate actor actions: they are DERIVED offers computed from the target's components (item in reach offers take; carried gear offers equip/unequip; carried fresh quest item offers eat), unioned with authored offers (open/dump stay explicit per container). The pack REGISTERS which authored action serves each derived role (special_actions, mirroring special_stances - no effect-sniffing). Actor-side requirements (e.g. size to take) are enforced at act time server-side and mirrored in the client's option derivation, since the knowledge-derivation gate no longer applies."